### The open core's words in English: the emails it sends (the layout
### every email shares, and the password reset). Every message has a note
### above it: where it shows, who reads it, and what each variable holds.

## Every email

# The button's words when an email names no other.
email-cta-default = 打开 Flash
# Above the button's address, written out for clients that hide buttons.
email-paste-link = 或者将此链接粘贴到您的浏览器中：
# The footer's line for questions. $email is the support address (a
# link); keep the markup as it is.
email-questions-html = 问题？回复此电子邮件，或写信给<a href="mailto:{ $email }" style="color:#6d6d75;">{ $email }</a>。
# The same line in the plain-text part. $email is the support address.
email-questions-text = 问题？回复此电子邮件，或写信至 { $email }

## Resetting a password

# The email's subject, and its title.
email-reset-subject = 重置您的 Flash 密码
# The preview line mail apps show beside the subject.
email-reset-preheader = 设置新密码。该链接有效一次，1 小时后失效。
# The email's heading.
email-reset-heading = 重置您的密码
# The email's first line.
email-reset-body = 有人（可能是您）要求重置此 Flash 帐户的密码。
# The button.
email-reset-cta = 设置新密码
# Under the button.
email-reset-expiry = 该链接有效一次，1 小时后失效。
# The footer's note.
email-reset-ignore = 如果您没有要求这样做，请忽略这封电子邮件。没有任何变化，您当前的密码仍然有效。
# Plain-text part: before the link.
email-reset-here = 在此设置新密码：
# Plain-text part: after the link.
email-reset-text-end = 该链接有效一次，1 小时后失效。如果这不是您本人，请忽略这封电子邮件。没有任何改变。
